o Kejie (Aar Texts and Translations)","covers":[1127699],"lc_classifications":["BL1941.F4513 2004","BL1941 .F4513 2004"],"key":"/books/OL7390989M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL234641A","name":"Livia Kohn"}],"isbn_13":["9780195170702"],"source_records":["amazon:0195170709:13:3997760151:186908","marc:marc_loc_updates/v35.i20.records.utf8:11867668:1231","marc:marc_loc_updates/v38.i16.records.utf8:3296377:1230","bwb:9780195170702","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part30.utf8:161228438:1230","ia:daoistmonasticma0000unse","amazon:0195170709","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-06-13","marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-010.mrc:310864927:3610","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.09.20150123.full.mrc:400926086:1016","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_035.bib.mrc:128566910:3836"],"title":"The Daoist Monastic Manual","number_of_pages":208,"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"isbn_10":["0195170709"],"publish_date":"June 3, 2004","works":[{"key":"/works/OL1955807W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"first_sentence":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Daoist monasteries and priestly training seminaries arose in the sixth century and came to flourish greatly under the Tang dynastly (618-907), which saw itself as divinely supported by Lord Lao, the central deity of the Daoist religion and claimed ancestor of the Tang ruling house."},"lccn":["2003009870"],"ocaid":"daoistmonasticma0000unse","local_id":["urn:bwbsku:T2-DGM-863"],"oclc_numbers":["52197414"],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"The Fengdao kejie or \"Rules and Precepts for Worshiping the Dao\" dates from the early seventh century and is a key text of medieval Daoist priesthood and monasticism, which was first formally organized in the sixth century. Compiled to serve the needs of both monastic practitioners and priests in training, it describes the fundamental rules, organizational principles, and concrete establishments of Daoist institutions. Speaking in their own voices and presenting the ideal Daoist life of their time, priests and recluses come to life in this ancient document.\"--BOOK JACKET."},"latest_revision":17,"revision":17,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-29T13:35:46.876380"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-04-17T05:46:16.854175"}}}}